        "nobel_worthiness": "HPV virus-like-particle vaccination is a conceptually clear preventive intervention against infection and major human cancers, with exceptional population-health consequences.",
        "attribution": "The three credited investigators represent central virological, immunological, and translational contributions to the vaccine platform.",
        "maturity": "Long-term real-world reductions in HPV infection, precancerous lesions, and cervical cancer make the effect mature and firmly established.",
