      "proposed_laureates": [
        "Jacques F. A. P. Miller",
        "Max D. Cooper"
      ],
      "assessment": {
        "nobel_worthiness": "Identification of distinct T- and B-cell lineages established a central organizing principle of adaptive immunity.",
        "attribution": "Miller's work on thymus-dependent lymphocytes and Cooper's delineation of B-cell biology form a complementary, appropriately bounded attribution.",
        "maturity": "The findings have underpinned decades of immunology, disease understanding, and therapeutic development.",
        "uncertainties": [
