        "nobel_worthiness": "TNF blockade transformed rheumatoid arthritis treatment and validated cytokine targeting as a broadly consequential therapeutic strategy.",
        "attribution": "Feldmann and Maini provide a coherent pairing of pathogenic insight and decisive clinical translation.",
        "maturity": "Sustained clinical use across inflammatory diseases and extensive follow-on validation demonstrate durable impact.",
        "uncertainties": [
          "TNF biology and development of individual blocking agents involved wider scientific and industrial contributions."
        ]
      }
    },
