      ],
      "assessment": {
        "nobel_worthiness": "GLP-1 physiology led to therapies with major, reproducible benefits in diabetes and obesity and substantial wider medical implications.",
        "attribution": "Holst, Mojsov, and Drucker represent key discovery and physiological-development contributions, though the full translational history is extensive.",
        "maturity": "Clinical benefit is well established at scale, while long-term effects and optimal use continue to be defined.",
        "uncertainties": [
